{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wall_softwood","model_identifier":"wall_softwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# wall_softwood\n\nSoftwood wall: a straight segment one column (16 u) long along X, outer face toward -Z. End caps at both ends meet the next segment's cap to form a joint post. Timber (pale, rough, rope-lashed softwood logs), 3 m (106 u) with pointed tops and a fighting step behind at 78 u.\n\n- Footprint: 1 x 1 columns (16 x 16 units, 0.45 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -8..8, y 0..109, z -7..8 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 14, construction_0 18, construction_33 24, construction_66 29, ruined 10 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 16 x 106 x 16 centred at x 0, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `wall_softwood_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `wall_softwood_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_wall_softwood` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_wall_walk` at (0, 78, 6)\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"wall_log0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,0.0,-6.0],"to":[-4.0,106.0,-2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[19.0,0.0,23.0,106.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[23.0,0.0,27.0,106.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[19.0,0.0,23.0,106.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[23.0,0.0,27.0,106.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8.0,157.0,12.0,161.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8.0,157.0,12.0,161.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"71a768b4-1510-5aab-97be-23f97b687b77"},{"name":"wall_tip0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,106.0,-5.0],"to":[-5.0,109.0,-3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24.0,157.0,26.0,160.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[26.0,157.0,28.0,160.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[24.0,157.0,26.0,160.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[26.0,157.0,28.0,160.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[16.0,179.0,18.0,181.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[16.0,179.0,18.0,181.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"945d764e-d695-5e22-953d-b8d15eaed016"},{"name":"wall_log1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,0.0,-6.0],"to":[0.0,102.0,-2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[31.0,0.0,35.0,102.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[35.0,0.0,39.0,102.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[31.0,0.0,35.0,102.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[35.0,0.0,39.0,102.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12.0,157.0,16.0,161.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[12.0,157.0,16.0,161.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0c3229e3-77fd-5569-85b0-9632a4a4de61"},{"name":"wall_tip